# Stab: "Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn." Bot2 has Hired Blade (3/2) and Sylvan Caryatid (0/3, hexproof) out.
# Stab only names creatures: the refusals are Bot2 (a player), Mox Ruby (a noncreature permanent) and the hexproof
# Caryatid (CR 702.11b); the positive control is the Stab on Hired Blade, whose toughness 2 -2 = 0 puts it into the
# graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5f). The Caryatid stays where it is, and Stab goes to its owner's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Stab
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Sylvan Caryatid
Hired Blade
Island x14

